# Contact Hub has no settings of its own. The aityx key you use in the app
# is the one you set on the index page ("Your aityx key"), kept in your
# browser. The repository's .env (see ../.env.example) can hold a dev key,
# AITYX_API_KEY, with AITYX_URL: the index server lends it to the app
# through its own proxy, never to the browser, and scripts/model-test.sh
# and contacthub_app/tool/route_samples.dart call aityx with it. Never put
# a key in the app: anything compiled in is readable in the web bundle.
